# Verification OUTPUT, not source. The parity runs produce ~60 MB of raw engine
# dumps (two full observation streams plus 10 MB tty captures per engine). They
# are what the diff was computed FROM, they regenerate from the scripts here,
# and their identity is already recorded by checksum in the reports that are
# tracked. Keeping them out of git keeps the repo usable.
*.ndjson
*.tty.bin
*.log
reproA_*/
reproB_*/
